BFS or DFS encoding with sentinels for null nodes. Reverse the format to decode.

```python
class Node:
    def __init__(self, x):
        self.val = x
        self.left = None
        self.right = None

def serialize(root):
    out = []
    def dfs(n):
        if not n:
            out.append('#')
            return
        out.append(str(n.val))
        dfs(n.left)
        dfs(n.right)
    dfs(root)
    return ','.join(out)
```

